      "span_duration": 1.1000000000000005,
      "speech_duration": 1.1000000000000005,
      "text": "the saddest act here."
    },
    {
      "run_index": 2,
      "speaker": "FACE_3",
      "segment_indices": [
        2
      ],
      "start": 7.8,
      "end": 8.24,
      "span_duration": 0.4400000000000004,
      "speech_duration": 0.4400000000000004,
      "text": "Bye."
    },
    {
      "run_index": 3,
      "speaker": "FACE_5",
      "segment_indices": [
        3,
        4,
        5,
        6
      ],
      "start": 10.16,
      "end": 20.96,
      "span_duration": 10.8,
      "speech_duration": 9.819999999999997,
      "text": "All right, all right. Well, obviously it's me, isn't it? I mean, I work in a city in a job I don't understand. Everyone keeps getting promoted above me. I haven't had a girlfriend since... well, since puberty."
    },
    {
      "run_index": 4,
      "speaker": "FACE_5",
      "segment_indices": [
        7,
        8,
        9,
        10,
        11
      ],
      "start": 22.75999999999999,
      "end": 31.24,
      "span_duration": 8.480000000000008,
      "speech_duration": 6.300000000000008,
      "text": "And... nobody fancies me. And if these cheeks get any chubbier, they never will. Nonsense. I fancy you. Me? Yeah."
    },
    {
      "run_index": 5,
      "speaker": "FACE_1",
      "segment_indices": [
        12,
        13
      ],
      "start": 31.96,
      "end": 33.7,
      "span_duration": 1.740000000000002,
      "speech_duration": 1.5200000000000031,
      "text": "Well, I did before you got so fat. You"
    },
    {
      "run_index": 6,
      "speaker": "8",
      "segment_indices": [
        14,
        15
      ],
      "start": 33.7,
      "end": 35.4,
      "span_duration": 1.6999999999999957,
      "speech_duration": 1.1799999999999926,
      "text": "see? And"
    },
    {
      "run_index": 7,
      "speaker": "FACE_3",
      "segment_indices": [
        16,
        17
      ],
      "start": 35.4,
      "end": 43.52,
      "span_duration": 8.120000000000005,
      "speech_duration": 7.660000000000011,
      "text": "unless I'm much mistaken, your job still pays you rather a lot of money, whilst Honey here earns 20 pence a week flogging her guts out in London's worst record store."
    },
    {
      "run_index": 8,
      "speaker": "FACE_1",
      "segment_indices": [
        18,
        19,
        20,
        21,
        22,
        23
      ],
      "start": 43.8,
      "end": 57.5,
      "span_duration": 13.700000000000003,
      "speech_duration": 10.639999999999993,
      "text": "Yes! And I haven't got hair. I've got feathers. And I've got funny, goggly eyes. And I'm attracted to cruel men. And actually, no-one will marry me because, um, my buzzies have actually started shrinking. You"
    },
    {
      "run_index": 9,
      "speaker": "6",
      "segment_indices": [
        24,
        25
      ],
      "start": 57.5,
      "end": 59.22,
      "span_duration": 1.7199999999999989,
      "speech_duration": 1.4600000000000009,
      "text": "see, it's incredible. Yeah,"
    },
    {
      "run_index": 10,
      "speaker": "FACE_1",
      "segment_indices": [
        26
      ],
      "start": 59.3,
      "end": 60.8,
      "span_duration": 1.5,
      "speech_duration": 1.5,
      "text": "but on the other hand, her best friend is"
    },
    {
      "run_index": 11,
      "speaker": "FACE_4",
      "segment_indices": [
        27
      ],
      "start": 60.8,
      "end": 61.22,
      "span_duration": 0.4200000000000017,
      "speech_duration": 0.4200000000000017,
      "text": "Anna Scott."
    },
    {
      "run_index": 12,
      "speaker": "FACE_1",
      "segment_indices": [
        28
      ],
      "start": 61.48,
      "end": 64.22,
      "span_duration": 2.740000000000002,
      "speech_duration": 2.740000000000002,
      "text": "Oh, well, that's true. I can't deny it. I mean, she needs me. What can I say?"
    },
    {
      "run_index": 13,
      "speaker": "FACE_4",
      "segment_indices": [
        29,
        30,
        31,
        32
      ],
      "start": 66.66,
      "end": 79.1,
      "span_duration": 12.439999999999998,
      "speech_duration": 9.899999999999991,
      "text": "And most of her limbs work, whereas I'm stuck in this thing day and night in a house full of ramps. And to add insult to serious injury... I've totally given up smoking. My favourite thing."
    },
    {
      "run_index": 14,
      "speaker": "FACE_4",
      "segment_indices": [
        33,
        34,
        35
      ],
      "start": 81.06,
      "end": 86.2,
      "span_duration": 5.140000000000001,
      "speech_duration": 2.980000000000004,
      "text": "And, um... Well, the truth is... we can't have a baby."
    },
    {
      "run_index": 15,
      "speaker": "7",
      "segment_indices": [
        36
      ],
      "start": 92.8,
      "end": 93.7,
      "span_duration": 0.9000000000000057,
      "speech_duration": 0.9000000000000057,
      "text": "That's what I am. And she's my girlfriend. Belle..."
    },
    {
      "run_index": 16,
      "speaker": "FACE_4",
      "segment_indices": [
        37
      ],
      "start": 95.8,
      "end": 96.62,
      "span_duration": 0.8200000000000074,
      "speech_duration": 0.8200000000000074,
      "text": "C'est la vie."
    },
    {
      "run_index": 17,
      "speaker": "FACE_4",
      "segment_indices": [
        38,
        39
      ],
      "start": 100.88,
      "end": 106.04,
      "span_duration": 5.160000000000011,
      "speech_duration": 4.460000000000022,
      "text": "Still, um, we're lucky in lots of ways, but surely that's worth a brownie."
    },
    {
      "run_index": 18,
      "speaker": "FACE_3",
      "segment_indices": [
        40,
        41
      ],
      "start": 108.78,
      "end": 112.82,
      "span_duration": 4.039999999999992,
      "speech_duration": 2.59999999999998,
      "text": "Well, I don't know. I don't know. Look at William."
    },
    {
      "run_index": 19,
      "speaker": "7",
      "segment_indices": [
        42
      ],
      "start": 114.46000000000001,
      "end": 115.9,
      "span_duration": 1.4399999999999977,
      "speech_duration": 1.4399999999999977,
      "text": "Very unsuccessful professionally."
    },
    {
      "run_index": 20,
      "speaker": "FACE_4",
      "segment_indices": [
        43
      ],
      "start": 116.5,
      "end": 117.02,
      "span_duration": 0.519999999999996,
      "speech_duration": 0.519999999999996,
      "text": "That's true."
    },
    {
      "run_index": 21,
      "speaker": "FACE_3",
      "segment_indices": [
        44,
        45
      ],
